to start. \n, https://t.co/MfWDztWj9f", "url": "https://x.com/JasonAten/status/2116356928612012541"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116212676346961920"]}, "author_id": "2034011420417785856", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:58:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116213090635411543"], "id": "2116213090635411543", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It’s so hard to learn hardware as a beginner!\n\nI was playing with Meta Muse on my StickS3 and realized… I don’t even know how a button works😥\n\nSo I built this interactive website to help me understand what’s happening inside.\n\nShould I turn this into a skill for others to use? https://t.co/ubKL78iQD4", "url": "https://x.com/louisetang_/status/2116213090635411543"}, {"author_id": "1972378540344795137", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:47:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116210385380618481"], "id": "2116210385380618481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I Tried Meta Muse AI Video Generation: Here’s What Happened https://t.co/orD0vJ1T9G via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Skrs8xi1/status/2116210385380618481"}, {"author_id": "1865188760423448576", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:40:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116193414186455261", "2116193594088251766"], "id": "2116193594088251766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I tried muse for the first time and I am still debating if I like it more than dots! To me it feels less mechanical and thinks along side of me. It helped me with tasks that I needed to get done and organized them at a different angle I didn’t consider! That alone was a huge", "url": "https://x.com/teeks86/status/2116193594088251766"}, {"author_id": "64041638", "c